<p>Art Resources are all Art created and stored in the Dragon Age file system. Creators of world maps will need Art Resources to shape them with Models, while creators of face morphs need Models of Faces. With that ,they are also creating Art Resources.
This is Part of the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Art" title="Art">Art</a> Category.
</p>
